    {
      "id": "d7Zm2KbnW5HoWEeMyawsA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 188.63744893527337,
      "y": 1226.8307060514217,
      "width": 1142.461873372396,
      "height": 950,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "frxoHK9ajFTvfzwIN-pDM",
        "s4qsQqZ6z4Eilv515fqn_"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4wV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 884401406,
      "version": 619,
      "versionNonce": 908084898,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790933799505,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Binarize the weights to either +1 or −1 with the signum function and centralize the weights to be zero-mean before\nbinarization.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nfurther quantize the activations to b-bit precision.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFor the activations before the non-linear functions (e.g., ReLU), we scale them into the range [0, Qb ]\nby subtracting the minimum of the inputs so that all values are non-negative:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Binarize the weights to either +1 or −1 with the signum function and centralize the weights to be zero-mean before binarization.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nfurther quantize the activations to b-bit precision.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFor the activations before the non-linear functions (e.g., ReLU), we scale them into the range [0, Qb ]\nby subtracting the minimum of the inputs so that all values are non-negative:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
